{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>As her soul departed, for she died.</b> And she did not die. [Meaning: she did not die] immediately." "<b>Binyamin.</b> If you say, why was he called by this name, which alludes to 'son of my right hand'? One may say: בן ימים — a son of old age, i.e., he will be my right hand in my old age. An analogy: there is none who holds by her hand like a son she has raised."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:25.499688977Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}